Workspace note: this directory is not a Git repository, so no baseline commit exists.
The following is the exact implementation inventory; inspect the named current files and lines.

--- post_analysis/model_comparison/collect.py
+++ post_analysis/model_comparison/collect.py
@@ event-aligned statistics
+ Added EVENT_RELATIVE_POSITIONS and TRANSITION_EVENT_CATEGORIES.
+ Replaced _event_aligned_unit_scalar with public event_aligned_unit_scalar(...,
+ relative_positions=None). It rejects duplicate (unit,model,position) rows and
+ incomplete position sets before averaging.
+ Added _validate_matched_event_counts to require equal per-unit event counts
+ across M0-M4 for matched units.
+ Extended common_event_window_ids/common_event_session_ids with optional
+ relative_positions and the new validation.
+ Added compute_sliding_window_event_aligned_trial0_paired_tests for the two
+ transition directions, using position 0 and adjacent_pairwise_tests.
+ collect.run now writes sliding_window_event_aligned_trial0_paired_pairwise.csv.

--- post_analysis/model_comparison/figures.py
+++ post_analysis/model_comparison/figures.py
@@ paired annotations
+ Added _paired_effect_summary. Direction is derived from
+ median_diff_a_minus_b: positive means model_b has lower NLL; negative means
+ model_a has lower NLL. _draw_adjacent_significance and event text display
+ that model with a down-arrow, significance stars, and Holm-adjusted p.
+ Figure 01 and 03 captions explain the paired direction. Figure 01 and all
+ sliding-window p-values remain explicitly exploratory.

@@ Figure 09
+ Added MODEL_SPECIFIC_PARAMETER_CARDS for ah, delta0, alpha_theta, bh.
+ Layout is now 4x2 (trajectory + meaning card). Legends show per-model N.
+ Trajectories are reindexed to all chronological ranks so missing M4 windows
+ create visible gaps rather than connected lines.

@@ Figure 16
+ fig_sliding_window_event_aligned_nll now takes a third trial-0 pairwise table.
+ Uses 3x4 GridSpec: existing four trajectory panels span pairs of columns in
+ the first two rows; bottom row has box+strip panels for S→L trial 0, L→S
+ trial 0, S→L whole -5..+5 range, L→S whole range.
+ Each summary panel uses event_aligned_unit_scalar and exact common windows.
+ Registry fig16 dependency includes the new trial-0 pairwise CSV.

--- post_analysis/model_comparison/report.py
+++ post_analysis/model_comparison/report.py
+ Loads/reports trial-0 results and documents the two Figure 16 estimands.
+ Significant result text names the lower-NLL model from the paired median
+ difference; non-significant text reports direction as descriptive only.

--- tests/test_post_analysis_model_comparison.py
+++ tests/test_post_analysis_model_comparison.py
+ Registry test expects the third fig16 CSV and exact renderer argument.
+ Added tests that trial-0 uses position 0 for both transition directions.
+ Added failures for incomplete position coverage and unequal event counts.
+ Added report paired-direction regression test.

--- post_analysis/README.md
+++ post_analysis/README.md
+ Documents the new CSV and updated Figure 09/Figure 16 layouts.
